      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Acute massive pulmonary embolism is known to be associated with high mortality, and treatment options may be limited if systemic fibrinolysis is contraindicated. We report the exciting results of a novel mechanical-pharmacological hybrid approach in 3 patients with life-threatening massive pulmonary embolism, in whom systemic fibrinolysis was contraindicated."},
